# nasa-neo app API — local dev requests
# Start the app with: ./run_local_dev.sh

### Health check
GET http://localhost:8080/health

### NEOs for current week (week 44, 2026)
GET http://localhost:8080/neo/week/44

### NEOs for current week — hazardous only
GET http://localhost:8080/neo/week/44?filter=hazardous
